From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: IamMaxim <g.maxim.stepanoff@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 28 May 2026 22:19:45 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] strip: remove copilot + copilot_chat + copilot_ui crates
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Removes GitHub Copilot integration entirely:
 - Delete crates/copilot (LSP-based inline completions).
 - Delete crates/copilot_chat (Copilot Chat REST API client).
 - Delete crates/copilot_ui (sign-in / configuration UI).
 - Delete language_models/src/provider/copilot_chat.rs and drop
   CopilotChatLanguageModelProvider registration.

Settings + enum surgery:
 - settings_content::EditPredictionProvider drops the Copilot variant
   (default is now None) and CopilotSettingsContent goes away.
 - language::CopilotSettings drops too; EditPredictionSettings stops
   carrying a copilot field.
 - ai_onboarding::EditPredictionOnboarding no longer offers Copilot.
 - edit_prediction: copilot_for_project, start_copilot_for_project,
   the per-project copilot field, and the SignIn/SignOut/Reinstall
   action handlers are removed.

Consumers cleaned up:
 - edit_prediction_ui/edit_prediction_button.rs: drop the Copilot
   render arm, the build_copilot_*_menu helpers, the avail-providers
   GlobalCopilotAuth probe, hide_copilot, and the
   copilot_settings_url unit tests.
 - editor: copilot_enabled / copilot_enabled_for_language locals (which
   were already telemetry-only after patch 0001) are deleted.
 - agent_ui: the EditPredictionProvider::Copilot command-palette branch
   merges into the generic show-actions branch.
 - agent: drop the 'copilot_chat' special-case in the auth-error log.
 - language_models/extension.rs: drop the copilot_chat → copilot-chat
   builtin→extension mapping.
 - language_tools/lsp_log_view.rs: remove try_ensure_copilot_for_project
   and its caller; project log-store loses copilot_log_subscription.
 - language_tools/lsp_button.rs: drop the unused copilot_enabled probe.
 - settings_ui/edit_prediction_provider_setup.rs: drop the GitHub
   Copilot section.
 - zed::edit_prediction_registry: drop Copilot variant +
   register_backward_compatible_actions becomes a no-op.
 - zed: drop copilot_chat::init / copilot_ui::init in main.rs and
   the visual-test-runner zed.rs::init_test; drop 'copilot' from the
   action-namespaces test.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
